    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n64038" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λύγξ</span></b>  (B), ἡ, gen.
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λυγγός, </span>(<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λύζω</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>hiccup</i>,
				<i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>Aph.</u>
				5.58
			</span></i>, al., <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Smp.</u>
				185d
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λ. κενή</span> an ineffectual
				<i>retching</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Th.
				2.49
			</span></i>, cf. Aret <i><span class="en">
				<u>CA</u>
				2.4
			</span></i>: masc. in pl., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τοῖς λυγξί</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Gal.
					1.356
				</span></i>
			, but fem. in <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				15.846
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λύγγα θηρατηρίαν</span> dub. l. in <i><span class="en">
				S.
				<u>Fr.</u>
				474.1
			</span></i>.</div>
